('cjk', 'CJK_JP', 'en', 'challenges', 'quality_standards', 'Japan, Korea, and China demand pixel-perfect localization — machine translation is considered disrespectful to audiences.', 'Japan, Korea, and China demand pixel-perfect localization — machine translation is considered disrespectful to audiences.', 'refined-precise', 'approved', 1),
('cjk', 'CJK_JP', 'en', 'challenges', 'character_systems', 'Kanji, Hangul, and Simplified/Traditional Chinese require specialized rendering, typography, and NLP that most AI tools botch.', 'Kanji, Hangul, and Simplified/Traditional Chinese require specialized rendering, typography, and NLP that most AI tools botch.', 'refined-precise', 'approved', 1),
('cjk', 'CJK_JP', 'en', 'challenges', 'data_sovereignty', 'China''s PIPL, Japan''s APPI, and Korea''s PIPA create a complex web of data residency requirements for AI platforms.', 'China''s PIPL, Japan''s APPI, and Korea''s PIPA create a complex web of data residency requirements for AI platforms.', 'refined-precise', 'approved', 1),
('cjk', 'CJK_JP', 'en', 'challenges', 'aging_population', 'Rapidly aging populations in Japan and Korea demand accessible, elder-friendly healthcare content at unprecedented scale.', 'Rapidly aging populations in Japan and Korea demand accessible, elder-friendly healthcare content at unprecedented scale.', 'refined-precise', 'approved', 1),
